# twrp.flags — AIO LIVE placeholder (intentionally empty).
# The stub-time swap (aioswap.c, post LGZ unpack, pre init) replaces this
# file with families/<fam>/twrp.flags for the detected device. There are
# deliberately NO zuma defaults here: if you read this text in a booted
# image, the swap did not run.
# Swap kit: system/etc/twrp.flags.<fam> (shipped alongside).
